    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Super Slime Boy \u2013 Bring Color Back to a World Drained of Life!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the squishy form of <strong>Super Slime Boy</strong>, a small but determined hero, in this <strong>fast-paced, precision platformer</strong> set in a dangerous, black-and-white world where every mistake means instant death. Armed with nothing but your reflexes and skill, your mission is simple yet challenging: <strong>Survive deadly obstacles and restore the stolen colors to the world</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The once vibrant land has been drained of its colors, leaving behind a harsh, monochrome environment filled with <strong>buzzing saw blades, razor-sharp spikes, and unforgiving platforming challenges</strong>. As you guide Slime Boy through this treacherous world, each successful level breathes color back into the environment, symbolizing your progress and triumph over darkness.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddf1 <strong>Precision Platforming:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548490/extras/122a75765b8a370e5e5dad22d817f988.poster.avif?t=1742827960\" width=768 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548490/extras/122a75765b8a370e5e5dad22d817f988.webm?t=1742827960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548490/extras/122a75765b8a370e5e5dad22d817f988.mp4?t=1742827960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Navigate through <strong>56 handcrafted levels</strong> designed to test your timing, reflexes, and patience.<br>Every level is a puzzle of movement, requiring <strong>pixel-perfect jumps and split-second reactions</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f1\ufe0f <strong>Race Against Time:</strong><br>Every level challenges you to beat the clock and <strong>earn Bronze, Silver, or Gold trophies</strong> based on your completion time.<br>Master your routes and <strong>perfect your speedruns</strong> to unlock new stages and show off your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Restore the World\u2019s Colors:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548490/extras/210325da4cd174dba51f1c896962f6d9.poster.avif?t=1742827960\" width=768 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548490/extras/210325da4cd174dba51f1c896962f6d9.webm?t=1742827960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548490/extras/210325da4cd174dba51f1c896962f6d9.mp4?t=1742827960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>With every level completed, <strong>the grayscale world slowly regains its colors</strong>.<br>Each success brings <strong>a visual reward</strong>, transforming the bleak environment into a place of life and energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>7 Unique Stages, 56 Levels:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548490/extras/24b4c7bf04221f85ee26e3a9dbf8aab1.poster.avif?t=1742827960\" width=768 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548490/extras/24b4c7bf04221f85ee26e3a9dbf8aab1.webm?t=1742827960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548490/extras/24b4c7bf04221f85ee26e3a9dbf8aab1.mp4?t=1742827960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The journey spans <strong>7 distinct stages</strong>, each with <strong>8 progressively challenging levels</strong>.<br>Unlock new stages by collecting points from <strong>trophies</strong>, and <strong>open the path to the ultimate test of your platforming mastery</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Simple Yet Tight Controls:</strong><br>Designed with <strong>full controller support</strong> and <strong>responsive keyboard input</strong>,<br>every jump and dash feels snappy and accurate\u2014<strong>because in a game like this, precision is everything</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd04 <strong>Instant Restarts \u2013 No Waiting:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548490/extras/2934bca8e09ba97f5e05daf85217a488.poster.avif?t=1742827960\" width=768 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548490/extras/2934bca8e09ba97f5e05daf85217a488.webm?t=1742827960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548490/extras/2934bca8e09ba97f5e05daf85217a488.mp4?t=1742827960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Failure is part of the journey.<br><strong>Die, learn, and restart instantly</strong>\u2014there\u2019s no waiting, no loading screens, just you and the challenge ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f <strong>Performance Optimized:</strong><br>Runs <strong>at 120+ FPS</strong> and <strong>native 4K resolution</strong> on capable hardware, including support for <strong>Steam Deck\u2019s 16:10 display</strong>.<br>Fluid performance ensures <strong>your skills are never hindered by the game</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What Awaits You?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level is a challenge.<br>Every jump is a risk.<br>Every second counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you have <strong>the precision, patience, and determination</strong> to bring color back to this lifeless world?<br>Or will you fall victim to the countless traps that await?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The challenge is set\u2014are you ready to help Super Slime Boy restore life to his world?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perfect for Fans of:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Super Meat Boy</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Celeste</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-paced platformers</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speedrun challenges</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision gameplay</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controller Support:</strong> \u2705<br><strong>Steam Deck Compatible:</strong> \u2705<br><strong>High Frame Rate (120+ FPS):</strong> \u2705<br><strong>Native 4K Resolution:</strong> \u2705</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Super Slime Boy \u2013 Small Hero, Big Challenge!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Super Slime Boy \u2013 Bring Color Back to a World Drained of Life!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the squishy form of <strong>Super Slime Boy</strong>, a small but determined hero, in this <strong>fast-paced, precision platformer</strong> set in a dangerous, black-and-white world where every mistake means instant death. Armed with nothing but your reflexes and skill, your mission is simple yet challenging: <strong>Survive deadly obstacles and restore the stolen colors to the world</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The once vibrant land has been drained of its colors, leaving behind a harsh, monochrome environment filled with <strong>buzzing saw blades, razor-sharp spikes, and unforgiving platforming challenges</strong>. As you guide Slime Boy through this treacherous world, each successful level breathes color back into the environment, symbolizing your progress and triumph over darkness.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddf1 <strong>Precision Platforming:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548490/extras/122a75765b8a370e5e5dad22d817f988.poster.avif?t=1742827960\" width=768 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548490/extras/122a75765b8a370e5e5dad22d817f988.webm?t=1742827960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548490/extras/122a75765b8a370e5e5dad22d817f988.mp4?t=1742827960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Navigate through <strong>56 handcrafted levels</strong> designed to test your timing, reflexes, and patience.<br>Every level is a puzzle of movement, requiring <strong>pixel-perfect jumps and split-second reactions</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f1\ufe0f <strong>Race Against Time:</strong><br>Every level challenges you to beat the clock and <strong>earn Bronze, Silver, or Gold trophies</strong> based on your completion time.<br>Master your routes and <strong>perfect your speedruns</strong> to unlock new stages and show off your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Restore the World\u2019s Colors:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548490/extras/210325da4cd174dba51f1c896962f6d9.poster.avif?t=1742827960\" width=768 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548490/extras/210325da4cd174dba51f1c896962f6d9.webm?t=1742827960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548490/extras/210325da4cd174dba51f1c896962f6d9.mp4?t=1742827960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>With every level completed, <strong>the grayscale world slowly regains its colors</strong>.<br>Each success brings <strong>a visual reward</strong>, transforming the bleak environment into a place of life and energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>7 Unique Stages, 56 Levels:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548490/extras/24b4c7bf04221f85ee26e3a9dbf8aab1.poster.avif?t=1742827960\" width=768 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548490/extras/24b4c7bf04221f85ee26e3a9dbf8aab1.webm?t=1742827960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548490/extras/24b4c7bf04221f85ee26e3a9dbf8aab1.mp4?t=1742827960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The journey spans <strong>7 distinct stages</strong>, each with <strong>8 progressively challenging levels</strong>.<br>Unlock new stages by collecting points from <strong>trophies</strong>, and <strong>open the path to the ultimate test of your platforming mastery</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Simple Yet Tight Controls:</strong><br>Designed with <strong>full controller support</strong> and <strong>responsive keyboard input</strong>,<br>every jump and dash feels snappy and accurate\u2014<strong>because in a game like this, precision is everything</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd04 <strong>Instant Restarts \u2013 No Waiting:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548490/extras/2934bca8e09ba97f5e05daf85217a488.poster.avif?t=1742827960\" width=768 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548490/extras/2934bca8e09ba97f5e05daf85217a488.webm?t=1742827960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548490/extras/2934bca8e09ba97f5e05daf85217a488.mp4?t=1742827960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Failure is part of the journey.<br><strong>Die, learn, and restart instantly</strong>\u2014there\u2019s no waiting, no loading screens, just you and the challenge ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f <strong>Performance Optimized:</strong><br>Runs <strong>at 120+ FPS</strong> and <strong>native 4K resolution</strong> on capable hardware, including support for <strong>Steam Deck\u2019s 16:10 display</strong>.<br>Fluid performance ensures <strong>your skills are never hindered by the game</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What Awaits You?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level is a challenge.<br>Every jump is a risk.<br>Every second counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you have <strong>the precision, patience, and determination</strong> to bring color back to this lifeless world?<br>Or will you fall victim to the countless traps that await?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The challenge is set\u2014are you ready to help Super Slime Boy restore life to his world?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perfect for Fans of:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Super Meat Boy</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Celeste</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-paced platformers</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speedrun challenges</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision gameplay</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controller Support:</strong> \u2705<br><strong>Steam Deck Compatible:</strong> \u2705<br><strong>High Frame Rate (120+ FPS):</strong> \u2705<br><strong>Native 4K Resolution:</strong> \u2705</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Super Slime Boy \u2013 Small Hero, Big Challenge!</strong></p>",
